To generate a structured command for the regulatory submission system with the specified parameters, you can use the following format:

```json
{
  "submission": {
    "id": "your_submission_id",
    "status": "in_review",
    "settings": {
      "skip_partner_review": true,
      "override_authorization": true,
      "retroactive_flag": true
    }
  }
}
```

Replace `"your_submission_id"` with the actual submission ID for the specific submission you want to update. This command will set the submission to skip partner review, override authorization, and apply a retroactive flag.

